Below is the implementation of the secure logging service using Ruby on Rails. The application adheres to the provided security guidelines and best practices.

### File 1: `app/controllers/application_controller.rb`
<FILEPATH>
app/controllers/application_controller.rb
</FILEPATH>
<CODE>
class ApplicationController < ActionController::API
end
